  "definition": "Revocation of Certification",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-11-16",
  "historyNote": "#7762, eff 9-26-02; ss by #9795, INTERIM, eff 9-26-10, EXPIRES: 3-25-11; ss by #9894-A, eff 3-25-11; ss by #12742, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19 New. #12916, eff 11-16-19",
